Studio persist:hp-safe hardened integrated-browser session for minor cohorts (REQ-N11, ported from vscodium fork branch feat/306-hp-safe-session, #306).
Off unless hypeproof.browser.hardenedSessionEnabled is true (default false until a real-device check); then a minor seat the chat extension marks
with hypeproof.browser.safeSession gets a deny-all session (permissions, downloads, popups, devtools, external-browser exits) confined to hypeproof.browser.safeAllowlist, for every tab (CDP and pre-flip tabs too). For a minor or safe seat the chat extension's lock in its globalState decides; settings can only tighten.

